            "Consider a hypothetical group where two accepted items are stored and a third seller has not dispatched. Compare waiting for that item, shipping the accepted group or requesting an available storage extension. Ask what concrete benefit waiting is expected to create. If the missing product has no reliable dispatch information, repeated delay may not improve the plan. Record the choice and revisit it when new evidence arrives, rather than continually adding another unconfirmed week."
