            "Confirm that the updated deadline appears after the extension is completed. Save the receipt and set another review date before it expires. The published storage guidance warns about disposal after expiry under its conditions, so do not treat an unanswered question or a pending payment as a completed extension. If expiry is close, seek clarification immediately through the platform and retain the response. Avoid relying on an old blog's example fee as if it were a current invoice."
